{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "IGS Classic Arcade Collection",
    "steam_appid": 3417140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IGS Classic Arcade Collection brings back 8 beloved IGS arcade games to Steam for the first time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the excitement of classic arcade action with up to 4-player online co-op for select titles. Whether you're a longtime fan or discovering these games for the first time, this collection is packed with nostalgic fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection includes multiple games from the &quot;Knights of Valour&quot; series, complete with online multiplayer co-op support. It also includes popular arcade favorites such as &quot;Oriental Legend&quot; and &quot;Martial Masters&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Authentic arcade experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original game content has been completely preserved, and the fun experienced on the arcade machine has been reproduced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arcade style display perfectly captures the atmosphere of those days!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Online Multiplayer Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For select titles, unite with up to three other friends or players online and conquer challenges together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pit your skills against players worldwide by competing for top scores on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Indulge in Modern Conveniences</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games in this collection include difficulty options, allowing even novices to quickly get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also utilize the save/load anywhere function, letting players revisit challenges anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who master the games, push your limits by challenging the highest difficulty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Collection of works</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aKnights of Valour: Super Heroes\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aKnights of Valour Plus\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aKnights of Valour 2 - Nine Dragons\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aOriental Legend\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aOriental Legend Spooky\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMartial Masters\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDemon Front\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aThe Gladiator\u300b</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IGS Classic Arcade Collection brings back 8 beloved IGS arcade games to Steam for the first time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the excitement of classic arcade action with up to 4-player online co-op for select titles. Whether you're a longtime fan or discovering these games for the first time, this collection is packed with nostalgic fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection includes multiple games from the &quot;Knights of Valour&quot; series, complete with online multiplayer co-op support. It also includes popular arcade favorites such as &quot;Oriental Legend&quot; and &quot;Martial Masters&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Authentic arcade experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original game content has been completely preserved, and the fun experienced on the arcade machine has been reproduced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arcade style display perfectly captures the atmosphere of those days!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Online Multiplayer Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For select titles, unite with up to three other friends or players online and conquer challenges together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pit your skills against players worldwide by competing for top scores on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Indulge in Modern Conveniences</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games in this collection include difficulty options, allowing even novices to quickly get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also utilize the save/load anywhere function, letting players revisit challenges anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who master the games, push your limits by challenging the highest difficulty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Collection of works</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aKnights of Valour: Super Heroes\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aKnights of Valour Plus\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aKnights of Valour 2 - Nine Dragons\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aOriental Legend\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aOriental Legend Spooky\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMartial Masters\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDemon Front\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aThe Gladiator\u300b</p>",
